{
  "info": {
    "name": "Ticketing Serverless API",
    "description": "Import this file in Postman: File → Import → select this JSON.\nSet collection variables `baseUrl`, `eventId` (after POST /events) and `orderId` (after POST /orders).\n\nResponse envelope (JSON body): success uses `{ \"status\", \"message\", \"data\" }` (numeric status matches HTTP code; `data` may be null). Errors use the same fields plus `traceId` (API Gateway request id); validation errors put `{ \"errors\": { \"field\": \"msg\" } }` in `data` when applicable.\n\nAuth: register a CUSTOMER or ORGANIZER, then login to populate `accessToken` and `refreshToken` collection variables (the Login/Refresh requests have Tests scripts that do this automatically). Authenticated requests should send `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`.\n\nIdempotency: `POST /orders` and `POST /orders/{id}/pay` REQUIRE an `Idempotency-Key` header (any UUID). The same key + same payload returns the cached response; the same key with a different payload returns 422.\n\nPayment simulator (test cards):\n- Any Luhn-valid card other than the magic ones below succeeds.\n- 4000 0000 0000 0002 → 402 declined (`card_declined`)\n- 4000 0000 0000 0119 → 402 processing error\n\nNo real charges occur; the simulator does not call any external network.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://r8gjlndh1e.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "eventId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "idempotencyKeyCreate",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "idempotencyKeyPay",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"customer@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Sup3rL0ngPassword!\",\n  \"name\": \"Alice\",\n  \"role\": \"CUSTOMER\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json && json.data) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.data.refreshToken);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"customer@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Sup3rL0ngPassword!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json && json.data) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.data.refreshToken);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Events",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create event (ORGANIZER)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json && json.data && json.data.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('eventId', json.data.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Show de teste\",\n  \"description\": \"Opcional\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-06-15T20:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"location\": \"Lisboa\",\n  \"priceInCents\": 2500,\n  \"availableTickets\": 100,\n  \"currency\": \"EUR\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/events"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List events (public)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/events"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get event by id (public)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update event (ORGANIZER, owner only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Show atualizado\",\n  \"availableTickets\": 80\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete event (ORGANIZER, owner only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orders",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create order (CUSTOMER, idempotent)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('idempotencyKeyCreate') || pm.variables.get('rotateKey') === 'true') {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('idempotencyKeyCreate', require('uuid').v4());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json && json.data && json.data.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', json.data.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{idempotencyKeyCreate}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"eventId\": \"{{eventId}}\",\n  \"quantity\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/orders"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get order by id (CUSTOMER, owner only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Pay order (CUSTOMER, idempotent, simulator)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('idempotencyKeyPay') || pm.variables.get('rotateKey') === 'true') {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('idempotencyKeyPay', require('uuid').v4());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{idempotencyKeyPay}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"card\": {\n    \"number\": \"4242 4242 4242 4242\",\n    \"holderName\": \"Alice Example\",\n    \"expiryMonth\": 12,\n    \"expiryYear\": 2030,\n    \"cvv\": \"123\"\n  },\n  \"billingAddress\": {\n    \"line1\": \"Rua Augusta 100\",\n    \"city\": \"Lisboa\",\n    \"state\": \"Lisboa\",\n    \"postalCode\": \"1100-053\",\n    \"country\": \"PT\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/pay"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
